8&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5NT8xCqqz6IQ7kNvwGuJ0X3&_nc_oc=Adr-cRRvJdeTgQaGicQpLgYy40LuxG9cymsHSwnSFKOgPbcFMJdx2TC1cZe2-31RxiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB5LCU3xQjyUWy0V2r3KEAso0GWqKLsPW17ENMDHL72Dg&oe=6A539940"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1361023465959928", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_1361023469293261_1206350505642553492_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UE0RwmBSYL4Q7kNvwEOXD8L&_nc_oc=Adqua4bH6_T_YgqGBg7Vs5iVktgME4yDVwyaCUZI94zpGoF1YPsvjuVwHzTXMwmtYFk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA_7rBHuQSLMk4xpTlqcsgQRxmfysAa-BnwTD64sK224g&oe=6A538311"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1419441870023360", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_1419441873356693_1211799693030602685_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dmUxFmp4EyYQ7kNvwELtDJO&_nc_oc=AdrDJvG3wdgSZi4BmYG8gUzUWXvQBGLmdO4aP-JM80kHsdgia4--Bi1hVLDvk3O0oG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBs90WLSuXMOubcCrlQxMLXmBOsgx6D1KfM2r7jg6hlJA&oe=6A53AD47"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1056275750057940", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1056275753391273_6255677838839533353_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2fOpvys9T_sQ7kNvwFWHbjO&_nc_oc=AdoN1-1EXE1wYKNpsx_Via7bLE-voHNndXhWuid5rpQQcxGeurzpHy_q0pi_Z-qWjwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAVOLQ7Hyv0zZMZDBT7RQvwCrJ9sKQX_A53laT62E_4BA&oe=6A53A04C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vertex VR Video Player", "keywords": ["cinema", "immersive", "player", "video", "VR180"], "long_description": "Vertex VR Video Player \u2014 a powerful VR video player for Meta Quest.\n\nProjection: Flat (cinema-style, adjustable curvature), 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 sphere, EAC (YouTube 360)\nStereo: SBS, Top-Bottom, Mono, SBS Fisheye\n\nKey features:\n- 2D\u21923D Converter (BETA) \u2014 turn flat films into side-by-side 3D on-device, resumable, saved locally\n- HDR \u2014 automatic HDR10 / HLG tone-mapping to SDR\n- Play Multiple \u2014 up to 3 videos at once (flat stacked or 180\u00b0+Flat mixed, gaze-based audio)\n- Network (SMB) streaming \u2014 play straight from a NAS/PC; credentials stored encrypted on-device\n- Subtitles \u2014 embedded + external .srt/.vtt, adjustable size/position, head-locked in 180\u00b0/360\u00b0\n- Spatial audio \u2014 head-tracked ambisonic (FOA/SOA/TOA) to binaural, multichannel Opus\n- 9 color profiles: Realism, Vivid, Teal & Orange, Vintage, PhotoReal, 3D, Mono, Cinema, SC\n- Auto refresh-rate match to video fps (judder-free)\n- Adjustable sharpness, clarity, brightness, contrast, saturation, gamma, warmth, depth\n- 4K/8K decoding, smooth buffered playback\n- Internal storage, USB OTG (NTFS), and SMB network playback\n- Auto-detects video type; VR menu with drag-to-pan and thumbstick zoom\n\nNo account required. Play offline from local storage/USB, or stream from your own network shares.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\n\ud83c\udfac JOIN OUR DISCORD \u2014 report bugs, request features, share feedback, chat with users:\n\ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/fT6vcTHXkG\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501", "short_description": "Vertex VR Video Player \u2014 high-quality VR player for Meta Quest. 2D\u21923D Converter (BETA): turn flat films into side-by-side 3D on-device. Plays 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 SBS/TB, flat & curved screen, EAC. Automatic HDR10/HLG tone-mapping. Play Multiple \u2014 up to 3 videos at once. Stream over your network (SMB) from a NAS/PC, plus internal storage & USB OTG (NTFS). Subtitles (embedded + .srt/.vtt, head-locked) and head-tracked spatial audio. 9 color profiles + auto refresh-rate match. Auto-detects video type."}]}, "developer_name": null, 